      "end_char": 378,
      "quote": "Around April 2, 2026, Priya collected four chairs while I kept two to finish."
    },
    "S4": {
      "start_char": 379,
      "end_char": 513,
      "quote": "Priya later alleged that I scratched all six chairs, but I only observed a mark on one chair and I have not inspected her photographs."
    },
